DESCRIPTION:Zine Folding Party with Little Zine Revolution\n\nSunday\, April 5\n\n11 AM - 2PM\n\nLloyd Center Food Court (3rd Floor)\n\n2201 Lloyd Center\, Portland\, OR\n\nAccessible by stairs\, escalator\, and elevator\n\nAssemble queer\, anti-fascist\, & anti-colonial zines\n\nNo experience necessary\n\nMasks encouraged\n\nCheck out @portlandzinemeetup while you're there and meet zine creators!
